[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 34991.426, "timestamp": "09:43:11", "text": "爸爸已經和我們在一起了。但這樣一來，他的權力也更大了，對吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 34998.47, "timestamp": "09:43:18", "text": "從某種意義上說，這讓丹現在更強大了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 35003.906, "timestamp": "09:43:23", "text": "啊，那很酷。我很慶幸能兩次得到他"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 35016.63, "timestamp": "09:43:36", "text": "等等，我們不是已經獲得一個角色了嗎？等等，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 35018.39, "timestamp": "09:43:38", "text": "等等。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 35020.71, "timestamp": "09:43:40", "text": "你們都看到了吧？我們得了C。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 35023.51, "timestamp": "09:43:43", "text": "等等，劍女在哪裡？等一下，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 35025.67, "timestamp": "09:43:45", "text": "等一下，等一下，等一下，等一下，等一下，等一下，等一下"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 35029.11, "timestamp": "09:43:49", "text": "，等一下。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 35031.23, "timestamp": "09:43:51", "text": "被騙了嗎？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 35034.23, "timestamp": "09:43:54", "text": "[音樂]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 35036.07, "timestamp": "09:43:56", "text": "什麼？"}]